---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Victoria" description="Meet Victoria Foreign Employment, a Victoria Group-associated workforce recruitment business focused on employers in Sri Lanka.">
  <section class="page-heading container"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT VICTORIA</p><h1>Business moves forward<br/><em>through people.</em></h1><div class="page-heading-bottom"><p>We connect employer requirements with recruitment and workforce coordination, with a focus on the work to be done and the people who will do it.</p><span class="editorial-note">LOCAL REQUIREMENTS.<br/>INTERNATIONAL PERSPECTIVE.</span></div></section>
  <section class="section container about-story"><div class="typographic-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-caption">VICTORIA FOREIGN EMPLOYMENT</span><span class="art-v">V</span><div class="art-rule"></div><span class="art-bottom">People. Purpose.<br/><em>Possibility.</em></span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR FOCUS</p><h2>The workforce behind<br/><em>your next chapter.</em></h2><p class="large-copy">1 Victoria Foreign Employment (PVT) LTD. is a recruitment and workforce business associated with Victoria Group.</p><p>We focus on employers in Sri Lanka, sourcing prospective workers principally from India and Nepal. Our service areas cover skilled construction, construction and site support, hotels and hospitality, and domestic workers.</p><p>From understanding a requirement to candidate sourcing, assessment, matching, and agreed coordination, the aim is to make the recruitment process clearer for the employer.</p><a class="text-link" href="/services/">Explore our expertise <Icon/></a></div></section>
  <section class="section leadership-section"><div class="container leadership-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">LEADERSHIP & RELATIONSHIPS</p><h2>A personal approach<br/>to <em>business.</em></h2></div><div><span class="leadership-label">BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT</span><h3>Dr. David Navaratnaraj</h3><p class="large-copy">Business relationships are central to Victoria’s development.</p><p>Dr. David Navaratnaraj is a key figure in the company’s relationship building and business development. In his supplied professional profile, he describes a background spanning engineering, business management, international business, and strategic networking.</p><p>His personal proposal identifies him as a director of 1 Victoria Foreign Employment and other Victoria-associated businesses.</p><p class="source-note">Leadership background is drawn from his supplied professional profile.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A SHARED GROUP ASSOCIATION</p><h2>Part of a broader<br/><em>business conversation.</em></h2></div><p>Victoria’s supplied company materials identify the following associated entities. Each has its own business identity.</p></div><div class="entity-list"><span>Victoria Group Inc.</span><span>Victoria Credits (Private) Limited</span><span>International Victoria Export & Import (Private) Limited</span><span>International Victoria Plantation (Private) Limited</span></div></section><CTA/>
</Layout>
